  "A Christmas Eve blast shook Saigon in 1964.",
  "Two Vietcong operatives detonated a car bomb beneath the Brinks Hotel.",
  "The building housed United States Army officers.",
  "The explosion killed 2 Americans and injured about 60 people.",
  "The attack aimed to prove American vulnerability in the capital.",
  "It sparked intense debate inside President Lyndon B. Johnson's administration."
